  "content": "<h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>📦 派大星不死圖騰 — 「不，我是派大星！」</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此材質包將經典的 Minecraft <strong>不死圖騰</strong> 替換為以海綿寶寶為靈感的像素風格 <strong>派大星</strong>。當你逃過死亡時，現在你將以<em>海星</em>的姿態重生！</p><h3>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>✨ 特色</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>🟣&nbsp;<strong>完全自訂的派大星紋理</strong>，用於不死圖騰&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d575dd01-cb8d-469d-aa4e-8bf585cb81eb.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"196\"></p><p><strong>啟動時也有特效</strong></p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_98a0e10c-02c3-41b4-aed8-f93657b0a5c4.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"216\"></p><p>🏷️ <strong>重新命名的物品</strong>：「派大星」</p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bf57ec2e-cea9-48dc-b330-1ec45ceba6c9.png\" width=\"221\" height=\"235\"></p><p>🎨 忠於原版風格的 Minecraft 像素藝術</p><p>🌊 專為主題世界、搞笑包或海綿寶寶粉絲設計</p><h3>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>🧩 相容性</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>支援 <strong>所有 1.20 至 1.21.10 版本</strong>（專門為 1.21.10 製作，舊版本可能顯示警告，但仍可正常使用）</p><p>與 <strong>OptiFine</strong> 和 <strong>原版 Minecraft</strong> 相容</p><p>無需安裝模組</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>我的其他作品 :)</strong></p><div>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;搭配派大星圖騰使用!!</strong></p>\n</div><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pochacco-hotbar-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332848/description_46a76311-2a63-459c-ba65-e6ce60f17097.png\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-undying-cat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332848/description_bcf8062b-7a11-4d89-ad7a-ada570c6f4b0.png\"></a></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/spongecraft-gui-jellyfish-krabby-patty-hud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1313684/description_c78c0a86-a479-406a-857f-8c0a152c019a.png\" width=\"245\" height=\"163\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/gingerbread-totem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1389953/description_1a9d691b-221f-4ab4-a1bb-ce3fd80bf3e7.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"215\"></a></p>",
